Z||000005||TI_3VOM||06-30-2001||06:25 PM||||...hey, hate to hijack a string here, but just had to ask a couple of related questions. <BR>(1) When you repainted you cars, did you strip the old paint off (and if so, how?), or did you just paint over the old?<BR>(2) Did you repaint with the panels still on the car, or did anyone repaint with all the body panels removed from the car?<P>...just had to ask.||||reg||5
